'''Clockwork''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[ClockWork Item Pack|Clockwork Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.  

== Appearance ==
Clockwork has a bright blue steel like blade with mini golden trapezoids on the left side of the blade. It also has a line streak in the middle of the blade. Its guard is golden with mini gears in the middle. The handle is wrapped in a brown rope with two golden rings on the bottom.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/356213216/Gearworks-Sword Gearworks Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux.
* Upon purchasing the [[Clockwork Item Pack]], players would receive this knife, the godly pet [[Steambird]], and the [[Gear Storm|Gearstorm]] effect.
* When salvaged, it provides 135 godly [[shards]].
*It is part of a set with the pet [[Steambird]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Clockwork_Set Clockwork Set].

